GetUsdValueTest
├── when token is not allowed
│   └── it should revert
└── when token is allowed
    ├── when amount is one whole token
    │   └── it should return the token price in usd
    ├── when amount is more than one token
    │   └── it should scale the price by the amount
    └── when another token has a different price
        └── it should use the price feed of the given token
